        <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the loss between the input predictions and the target values. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Pure virtual method to be implemented by derived classes with the specific loss computation. The returned tensor participates in the computational graph such that calling backward() on it will propagate gradients back through the network.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>input</parametername>
